{"availability":"available","full":"shiva-shivanibokka/Competitor-Insight-Engine","name":"Competitor-Insight-Engine","description":"AI-powered tool that scrapes any company's website, finds real-time competitors via Tavily search, and generates a full competitive intelligence report — including market comparison and strategic recommendations — using any LLM of your choice.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-08T20:46:18Z","updated":"2026-10-08T16:41:26Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://competitor-insight-engine.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://competitor-insight-engine.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:41.134Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:41.134Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:41.134Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:41.134Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Give it one company URL; get back a full competitor analysis report in 90 seconds.","▶ Live demo: competitor-insight-engine.vercel.app — opens on recorded real runs, so no keys are needed to watch it work. Bring your own model key (Groq/Gemini have free tiers) to run it against a company of your choice; it never leaves your browser.","Competitive research is usually manual: open a dozen browser tabs, read each company's site, take notes, and hand-build a comparison table. It's slow and it goes stale the moment a new competitor appears."],"features":["One-input analysis — a single company URL produces a complete Markdown report.","Live competitor discovery — Tavily web search finds current competitors, not a hardcoded list.","Two-layer competitor filtering — an LLM ranks candidates, then a hard-coded domain blocklist rejects forums/news/review sites, so only real companies survive.","Bring Your Own Key (BYOK) — pick a provider + model in the UI and paste your key; it's held in sessionStorage and sent browser → backend only. Never stored, logged, or seen by the hosting layer.","Six LLM providers, one code path — Anthropic, Google Gemini, Groq, OpenAI, Mistral, and local Ollama, all through a single OpenAI-compatible client. Switching models changes no code."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shiva-shivanibokka/Competitor-Insight-Engine/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"728dec1d0264a7b9f5120f08845d2e8100ece184508da53a9eeeec4f6fa8de31","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:41.301Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:41.301Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Give it one company URL; get back a full competitor analysis report in 90 seconds.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shiva-shivanibokka/Competitor-Insight-Engine/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Containerization & Docker — the API is a plain container (backend/Dockerfile) and can be self-hosted as one; the current deployment builds it from source instead.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shiva-shivanibokka/Competitor-Insight-Engine/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"Offline unit tests — no API keys needed (LLM/Tavily calls are monkeypatched). 23 of the 25 need no network at all; 2 resolve DNS (testssrfallowspublic and testreachabilitychecksdonotfollowredirectchains):","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shiva-shivanibokka/Competitor-Insight-Engine/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Scraping: unreachable main URL → stops with a checklist; page with little/no text → warns (or stops if truly empty) and suggests a specific sub-page; a competitor that 404s, redirects to a login, or times out → skipped, pipeline continues.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shiva-shivanibokka/Competitor-Insight-Engine/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"728dec1d0264a7b9f5120f08845d2e8100ece184508da53a9eeeec4f6fa8de31","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/shiva-shivanibokka/Competitor-Insight-Eng